{"seq":1,"slug":"transport-mode-distance-model","title":"运输方式与里程碳排放模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-logistics-carbon-footprint/fulfillment-emission-calc/transport-mode-distance-model","wordCount":1845,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"运输方式与里程碳排放模型\">运输方式与里程碳排放模型</h1><p>运输是跨境碳足迹里唯一一个&quot;用错一个系数就毁掉整份报告&quot;的环节。原因很直接：海运费是每吨每公里最低的，空运高出两个数量级，同一件货走海运还是走空运，运输段的碳排放能差一百倍以上。而运输强度本身又不是常数——它随载重率、空驶率、船型、燃料、航线距离浮动。这一篇讲怎么把这个浮动的强度变成可计算、可复算的模型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h3 id=\"有效强度的倒数效应\">有效强度的倒数效应</h3><p>运输排放的通用式是<strong>活动量乘以强度</strong>，而活动量在货运语境下就是运输作业量：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mtext>transport</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></munder><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>leg</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>leg</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mtext>mode, load</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_{\\text{transport}} = \\sum_{leg} W_{\\text{leg}} \\times D_{\\text{leg}} \\times I_{\\text{mode, load}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">transport</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4882em;vertical-align:-1.4382em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4382em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">leg</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">leg</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">mode, load</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 是货量（吨），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 是里程（公里），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span> 是该运输方式在当前装载状态下的排放强度（kg CO₂e / t·km）。货量乘里程得到 t·km，这就是运输作业量的基本单位。</p>\n<p>这个公式看着简单，但把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span> 展开就复杂了。强度可以按&quot;单车&quot;定义也可以按&quot;单位作业量&quot;定义，两者的换算需要载重率：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mtext>per tkm</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>每公里燃料消耗</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>燃料排放因子</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>实际载货吨位</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>空驶折算</mtext></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_{\\text{per tkm}} = \\frac{\\text{每公里燃料消耗} \\times \\text{燃料排放因子}}{\\text{实际载货吨位} + \\text{空驶折算}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">per tkm</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1297em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">实际载货吨位</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">空驶折算</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">每公里燃料消耗</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">燃料排放因子</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[运输段 leg] --&gt; B[货量 W 吨]&#10;  A --&gt; C[里程 D 公里]&#10;  A --&gt; D[运输方式 mode]&#10;  D --&gt; E[燃料类型]&#10;  D --&gt; F[载具吨位/船型]&#10;  A --&gt; G[装载率 load factor]&#10;  A --&gt; H[空驶率 empty running]&#10;  B --&gt; I[运输作业量 t·km]&#10;  C --&gt; I&#10;  E --&gt; J[基础强度 kgCO2e/tkm]&#10;  F --&gt; J&#10;  G --&gt; K[强度修正]&#10;  H --&gt; K&#10;  J --&gt; L[修正后强度]&#10;  K --&gt; L&#10;  I --&gt; M[该段排放]&#10;  L --&gt; M\">graph TD\n  A[运输段 leg] --&gt; B[货量 W 吨]\n  A --&gt; C[里程 D 公里]\n  A --&gt; D[运输方式 mode]\n  D --&gt; E[燃料类型]\n  D --&gt; F[载具吨位/船型]\n  A --&gt; G[装载率 load factor]\n  A --&gt; H[空驶率 empty running]\n  B --&gt; I[运输作业量 t·km]\n  C --&gt; I\n  E --&gt; J[基础强度 kgCO2e/tkm]\n  F --&gt; J\n  G --&gt; K[强度修正]\n  H --&gt; K\n  J --&gt; L[修正后强度]\n  K --&gt; L\n  I --&gt; M[该段排放]\n  L --&gt; M</pre><p>关键在于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mtext>装载率</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{\\text{装载率}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">装载率</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的放大效应。同一辆车，满载十吨跑一百公里和只装三吨跑一百公里，燃料消耗不会差三倍多（空气阻力与滚动阻力与重量弱相关），但分摊到每吨公里上，强度会差三倍以上。这就是为什么&quot;提高装载率&quot;是最便宜的减排杠杆之一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"各运输方式的强度量级与差异来源\">各运输方式的强度量级与差异来源</h2><h3 id=\"先判量级再谈优化\">先判量级再谈优化</h3><p>运输方式的强度差异不是靠记数字，而是靠理解每个方式里什么在驱动能耗。下面是一张数量级对比表，用于建立直觉（具体数值必须以实际因子库为准）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>运输方式</th>\n<th>强度量级（相对）</th>\n<th>主要驱动</th>\n<th>关键修正项</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>海运（集装箱船）</td>\n<td>1（基准）</td>\n<td>船型吨位、航速</td>\n<td>航速对能耗是三次方关系，慢航能省很多</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>铁路</td>\n<td>3–6</td>\n<td>电气化率、线路坡度</td>\n<td>电力因子区域化差异大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>公路（重型卡车）</td>\n<td>15–30</td>\n<td>载重率、路况、车型</td>\n<td>空驶回程是最大浪费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>公路（轻型货车/面包车）</td>\n<td>50–100</td>\n<td>按单计而非按吨计</td>\n<td>配送密度决定强度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>航空货运</td>\n<td>200–500</td>\n<td>载货率、机型、绕航</td>\n<td>腹舱带货的强度低于全货机</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>航空快递</td>\n<td>500–1000</td>\n<td>时效溢价</td>\n<td>与客机腹舱利用率强相关</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表的用法是：<strong>先判断量级，再谈优化</strong>。如果一家跨境卖家发现自己算出的运输排放里公路占比超过海运，先检查是不是把空运计入了&quot;公路&quot;，或者把尾程的轻型货车用量放大了——这类量级错误比系数误差常见得多。</p>\n<p>海运强度这几年有一个新的计量维度必须知道：国际海事组织（IMO）在 2021 年 6 月通过 MEPC.328(76) 决议引入现有船舶能效指数（EEXI）与碳强度指标（CII），于 2023 年 1 月 1 日生效。EEXI 适用于 400 总吨以上船舶，衡量技术/设计能效；CII 适用于 5000 总吨以上船舶，用实际油耗数据衡量运营碳强度，并按 A 到 E 五档评级（<a href=\"https://www.imo.org/en/OurWork/Environment/Pages/Improving%20the%20energy%20efficiency%20of%20ships.aspx\">IMO 船舶能效</a>）。CII 的年度收紧要求在 2023 至 2026 年间每年降低 2%，2027 至 2030 年进一步加严。对碳核算的实际意义是：<strong>你选哪家船公司、哪条船，正在产生可量化的强度差异</strong>，而且这个差异会在未来几年放大。D 级连续三年或 E 级的船必须提交纠正行动计划，这类船的运营策略（例如降速）会直接影响它能提供的强度数据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"燃料与能源类型-从油箱到全生命周期\">燃料与能源类型：从油箱到全生命周期</h2><h3 id=\"ttw-与-wtw-的口径迁移\">TTW 与 WTW 的口径迁移</h3><p>运输排放的口径分「油箱到车轮」（TTW，只算燃烧）与「油井到车轮」（WTW，含燃料生产与运输）。IMO 的 2023 年温室气体减排战略明确采用**全生命周期（Well-to-Wake）**方法，即把 Well-to-Tank 与 Tank-to-Wake 的排放因子合并，以捕捉燃料生产与燃烧两端的排放（<a href=\"https://www.imo.org/en/MediaCentre/PressBriefings/pages/Revised-GHG-reduction-strategy-for-global-shipping-adopted-.aspx\">IMO 减排战略</a>）。</p>\n<p>同一个战略给出的目标锚点值得记住，因为它决定了未来几年的默认口径：以 2008 年为基准，2030 年总排放至少降 20%、力争 30%；2040 年至少降 70%、力争 80%；并在 2050 年前后达到净零。也就是说，<strong>今天的运输排放核算正在从 TTW 迁向 WTW</strong>，而 WTW 的强度值比 TTW 高（多了燃料生产段）。如果你的因子库还是纯 TTW，与采用 WTW 的对手方对账时会出现系统性偏差。</p>\n<p>柴油的 WTW 强度比 TTW 高出约 15–25%，电动化的差异更大：电动车的 TTW 为零尾气，但 WTW 取决于电力来源的因子，用煤电时可能并不比柴油低多少。这解释了为什么<strong>电力因子必须区域化</strong>——它不是精度问题，而是结论方向问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"单位口径与计算实现\">单位口径与计算实现</h2><h3 id=\"距离口径的纪律\">距离口径的纪律</h3><p>运输模型的实现里，最容易出问题的是&quot;哪个距离算进去&quot;。跨境运输链路通常有这些段：起运地到港口（首公里）、港口到目的港（干线海运或空运）、目的港到海外仓（清关后陆运）、海外仓到买家（尾程）。此外还有两个常被忽略的项：<strong>回程空驶</strong>和<strong>绕航系数</strong>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 运输段排放明细：一段一行，保留所有修正系数以便复算&#10;CREATE TABLE transport_leg_emission (&#10;  leg_id            TEXT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  pcf_run_id        TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  seq               INT NOT NULL,           -- 链路顺序: 1 首公里, 2 干线, 3 清关陆运, 4 尾程&#10;  mode              TEXT NOT NULL,          -- ocean_sea / air_freight / road_hgv / road_lgv / rail&#10;  origin_code       TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  dest_code         TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  distance_km       NUMERIC(12,2) NOT NULL,&#10;  distance_basis    TEXT NOT NULL,          -- great_circle / road_network / carrier_reported&#10;  cargo_tonnes      NUMERIC(14,4) NOT NULL,&#10;  load_factor       NUMERIC(5,4) NOT NULL CHECK (load_factor &gt; 0 AND load_factor &lt;= 1),&#10;  empty_running_pct NUMERIC(5,4) NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  base_intensity    NUMERIC(14,8) NOT NULL, -- kgCO2e/tkm, 未修正&#10;  wtt_multiplier    NUMERIC(6,4) NOT NULL DEFAULT 1.0,&#10;  leg_kg_co2e       NUMERIC(18,6) NOT NULL,&#10;  factor_ref        TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  CHECK (distance_basis IN (&#39;great_circle&#39;,&#39;road_network&#39;,&#39;carrier_reported&#39;))&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- 有效强度 = 基础强度 / 装载率 * (1 + 空驶率) * WTW 系数&#10;-- 保证同一段在报表里可被完全复算&#10;CREATE VIEW transport_leg_effective AS&#10;SELECT leg_id, pcf_run_id, seq, mode, distance_km,&#10;       cargo_tonnes * distance_km AS tkm,&#10;       base_intensity / load_factor&#10;         * (1 + empty_running_pct) * wtt_multiplier AS effective_intensity,&#10;       leg_kg_co2e,&#10;       ROUND(base_intensity / load_factor * (1 + empty_running_pct)&#10;             * wtt_multiplier * cargo_tonnes * distance_km, 6) AS recomputed_kg_co2e&#10;FROM transport_leg_emission;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 运输段排放明细：一段一行，保留所有修正系数以便复算</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> transport_leg_emission</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  leg_id            </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  pcf_run_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  seq               </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,           </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 链路顺序: 1 首公里, 2 干线, 3 清关陆运, 4 尾程</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  mode              </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- ocean_sea / air_freight / road_hgv / road_lgv / rail</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  origin_code       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  dest_code         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  distance_km       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  distance_basis    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- great_circle / road_network / carrier_reported</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  cargo_tonnes      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  load_factor       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (load_factor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> load_factor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  empty_running_pct </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  base_intensity    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- kgCO2e/tkm, 未修正</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  wtt_multiplier    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  leg_kg_co2e       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  factor_ref        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (distance_basis </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'great_circle'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'road_network'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'carrier_reported'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 有效强度 = 基础强度 / 装载率 * (1 + 空驶率) * WTW 系数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 保证同一段在报表里可被完全复算</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> VIEW</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> transport_leg_effective</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> leg_id, pcf_run_id, seq, mode, distance_km,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       cargo_tonnes </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> distance_km </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tkm,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       base_intensity </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> load_factor</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> empty_running_pct) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> wtt_multiplier </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> effective_intensity,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       leg_kg_co2e,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       ROUND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(base_intensity </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> load_factor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> empty_running_pct)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">             *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> wtt_multiplier </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cargo_tonnes </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> distance_km, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> recomputed_kg_co2e</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> transport_leg_emission;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>把 <code>base_intensity / load_factor * (1 + empty_running_pct) * wtt_multiplier</code> 这条有效强度公式固化成视图，好处是任何一次审计都能拿 <code>recomputed_kg_co2e</code> 与 <code>leg_kg_co2e</code> 对账，差额即数据篡改或口径漂移的证据。</p>\n<p>距离口径的选择也有纪律：<strong>海运与空运用大圆距离</strong>（great circle）足够，但短途陆运在山区绕行会显著超过直线距离，必须用路网距离。更精确的做法是采用承运商报告的实际里程，但要接受承运商可能只给&quot;计费里程&quot;（含绕行与调度空驶），反而偏离物理量。见 <a href=\"../../emission-reduce-offset/fulfillment-decarbon-lever\">履约减排杠杆</a> 里关于路由优化的部分，那里的模型依赖的正是这里定义的距离口径。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>运输排放的基本式是 t·km 乘以强度；强度必须按装载率与空驶率修正，装载率的倒数是放大项。</li>\n<li>运输方式之间的强度差异是数量级的，先判量级再谈优化；海运和空运的差可以到两个数量级以上。</li>\n<li>IMO 的 EEXI/CII 于 2023 年生效，CII 按 A–E 评级，2023–2026 每年收紧 2%；船的选择正在产生可量化的强度差异。</li>\n<li>口径正在从 TTW 迁向 WTW；柴油的 WTW 比 TTW 高约 15–25%，电动化的结论取决于电力因子。</li>\n<li>把有效强度公式固化成视图，让每段运输排放可被独立复算。</li>\n<li>下一段：仓储与包装环节怎么算，见 <a href=\"../../fulfillment-emission-calc/warehousing-packaging-carbon\">仓储与包装环节碳排</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"运输方式与里程碳排放模型","id":"运输方式与里程碳排放模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"有效强度的倒数效应","id":"有效强度的倒数效应"},{"level":2,"text":"各运输方式的强度量级与差异来源","id":"各运输方式的强度量级与差异来源"},{"level":3,"text":"先判量级再谈优化","id":"先判量级再谈优化"},{"level":2,"text":"燃料与能源类型：从油箱到全生命周期","id":"燃料与能源类型-从油箱到全生命周期"},{"level":3,"text":"TTW 与 WTW 的口径迁移","id":"ttw-与-wtw-的口径迁移"},{"level":2,"text":"单位口径与计算实现","id":"单位口径与计算实现"},{"level":3,"text":"距离口径的纪律","id":"距离口径的纪律"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"数据质量与分摊规则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-logistics-carbon-footprint/pcf-method-boundary/data-quality-allocation-rule"},"next":{"title":"仓储与包装环节碳排","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-logistics-carbon-footprint/fulfillment-emission-calc/warehousing-packaging-carbon"}}